{#
    Email 03, "Your idea has arrived" (Site v4 design, Llunio Email Templates/
    03-commission-enquiry-received.html), with "Dorset Studio" for
    "Bournemouth". "We'll be in touch by …": the method a Home customer
    chose, "email" for Project (decided 7 October 2026). Commission type is the
    form's tab name. Laid out by email/_customer.html.twig (the email rules
    of Step 11.0).
#}
{% extends 'email/_customer.html.twig' %}
{% import 'email/_customer.html.twig' as layout %}

{% block title %}Your commission enquiry{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Thank you for sharing your idea. I'll be in touch to talk it through.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<p style="{{ body }}">Thank you for telling me about your idea. I'll be in touch by {{ enquiry.contactMethod == 'phone' ? 'phone' : 'email' }} to talk it through together, whether it's fully formed or still taking shape.</p>
{{ include('email/_signature.html.twig') }}
{{ layout.section('01', 'Enquiry') }}
<p style="{{ label }}">Enquiry reference</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ enquiry.enquiryNumber }}</p>
<p style="{{ label }}">Commission type</p>
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ enquiry.client.label }}</p>
{% endblock %}
